  "description": "Mapterhorn is a global collection of terrain tiles in PMTiles format covering the full Web Mercator projection extent. It encodes digital elevation model (DEM) data in Terrarium format, suitable for hillshading and 3D terrain rendering in interactive web maps. Source elevation data is drawn from open-data providers credited on the Mapterhorn attribution page.",
